---
/**
 * A venue heading within a Day, e.g. "Town Hall Seattle" -- can repeat
 * within a Day when the programme changes venues. Background approximates
 * the reference's rgba(255, 207, 7, 0.3) via the madrona-yellow token.
 */
---

<div
  class="location-band bg-madrona-yellow/30 font-display text-sound-navy p-4 text-2xl leading-none font-light"
>
  <slot />
</div>
